    "body":  "This is release v3.4. \r\n\r\n**History Version 3:**\r\n- Release v3.4 has 16 rescheduled projects to resolve resource conflicts (details are given in the \"Updates\" sheet of the accompanying Excel file)\r\n- Release v3.3 has errors solved for 11 projects (details are given in the \"Updates\" sheet of the accompanying Excel file)\r\n- Release v3.2 has errors solved for 24 projects (details are given in the \"Updates\" sheet of the accompanying Excel file)\r\n- Release v3.1 only contains minor changes in the Excel file. \r\n- Release v3.0 was the first release published on GitHub. \r\n\r\n**History Version 2:**\r\n- 28 new projects were added compared to release v2. Explore our research on data on www.or-as.be.\r\n- Previously, updates were shared via the website [www.projectmanagement.ugent.be/research/data](http://www.projectmanagement.ugent.be/research/data). From now on, all future updates will be published here on GitHub.\r\n"
